---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="About AfriMigrate | Connecting Africa to the World"
  description="AfriMigrate is a free migration planning tool for Africans, founded by Augustine Okafor in Manchester, UK. Our mission: make migration planning free for every African, forever."
>
  <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / About</div>
  <div class="eyebrow">About Us</div>
  <h1>Connecting Africa to the World</h1>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
    AfriMigrate was founded on a simple frustration: the information needed to move abroad legally already exists, for free, on government websites — but it's scattered, jargon-heavy, and hard to act on. Consultants charge thousands to bridge that gap. We built AfriMigrate to close it for free instead.
  </p>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">Our Story</div>
    <h2>Built by someone who's lived it</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px;">
      AfriMigrate is founded by Augustine Okafor, based in Manchester, UK. Having navigated the UK immigration system firsthand, Augustine saw how much time, money and stress could be saved with clear, free tools — and how disproportionately that burden falls on African applicants navigating unfamiliar systems from thousands of miles away.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">Our Mission</div>
    <h2>Free, forever — not a trial</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="max-width: 700px;">
      Every calculator, checklist and guide on AfriMigrate is 100% free and always will be. We believe migration planning shouldn't cost a fortune — it should be a public good, and we're building it as one for the entire African diaspora, not just one country's applicants.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">What Makes Us Different</div>
    <h2>Pan-African. Tool-based. Free.</h2>
    <div class="tools-grid">
      <div class="tool-card"><div class="tool-icon">🌍</div><h3>Pan-African</h3><p>Built for every African, not just one country — most tools in this space focus narrowly on Nigeria.</p></div>
      <div class="tool-card"><div class="tool-icon">🆓</div><h3>Free forever</h3><p>No paid tiers hiding the tools you actually need. We monetise through optional add-ons, never by gating the basics.</p></div>
      <div class="tool-card"><div class="tool-icon">🧮</div><h3>Tool-based</h3><p>Real calculators and checklists you can act on immediately — not just a chatbot giving general advice.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">Get In Touch</div>
    <h2>Follow the journey</h2>
    <p class="lead">We share new tools, visa updates and migration tips regularly.</p>
    <a href="https://instagram.com/afrimigrate.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Follow @afrimigrate.app →</a>
  </section>
</Layout>
